WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:28.000
ADAPTED FROM THE LEGEND
OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:36.560 --> 01:37.720
Hurry, notify the Inspector!

01:40.440 --> 01:41.360
Move back!

01:42.160 --> 01:43.120
Cui Shijiu!

01:49.920 --> 01:52.200
I knew you were trying
to play hard to get.

01:52.280 --> 01:53.400
Well, perfect timing.

01:54.560 --> 01:58.920
I ended up in this state today,

01:59.440 --> 02:01.600
and it's all because of the two of you!

02:01.680 --> 02:03.960
Leave me alone. Kill him!

02:04.040 --> 02:05.480
Shut up!

02:06.080 --> 02:10.840
I'll kill Cui Shijiu first,
and then I'll take your lives!

02:12.080 --> 02:14.600
Do you really think
I care whether she lives or dies?

02:24.680 --> 02:27.480
Do you still remember
what I taught you in the woods?

02:31.920 --> 02:33.000
Keep your elbow steady,

02:33.680 --> 02:35.040
pull back.

02:43.920 --> 02:44.920
Zheng Shiyuan,

02:48.800 --> 02:52.680
you're not getting away today,
no matter what.

02:54.400 --> 02:55.280
What are you doing?

02:55.880 --> 02:58.520
-Don't come closer! Step back!
-Kill him…

02:59.520 --> 03:02.360
If you take another step, I'll kill her!

03:14.400 --> 03:15.840
Don't force me.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.840
Don't push me!

03:20.200 --> 03:21.040
Stay back!

04:05.680 --> 04:06.720
Cui Shijiu!

04:08.040 --> 04:09.040
Cui Shijiu!

04:09.120 --> 04:13.360
Quick, get a doctor! Get a doctor!
Hurry, get a doctor!

04:16.240 --> 04:17.399
Cui Shijiu…

04:18.399 --> 04:19.480
Cui Shijiu…

04:23.320 --> 04:25.080
LEDGER

04:35.680 --> 04:37.080
Su Muzhe…

04:38.440 --> 04:42.720
today is a day worth…

04:43.240 --> 04:44.960
celebrating.

04:47.280 --> 04:48.320
Doctor!

04:49.240 --> 04:50.600
Has the doctor arrived?

04:51.960 --> 04:53.360
As expected,

04:53.880 --> 04:56.320
Prince Ying, Yuchi Wuyi,
and Zheng Shiyuan,

04:56.400 --> 04:58.760
their alliance seems unbreakable,

04:59.280 --> 05:01.480
but in truth,
they're just using each other.

05:02.000 --> 05:06.160
Especially the weakest one, Zheng Shiyuan,
who has been secretly holding back a card.

05:06.240 --> 05:07.960
If Prince Ying is the mastermind,

05:08.480 --> 05:10.440
and Yuchi Wuyi appears
as the Master of Langhuan Dockyard,

05:10.520 --> 05:12.200
but is actually the leader
of Black Dragon Bandits Li Kui,

05:12.280 --> 05:13.480
raiding trading convoys for Prince Ying,

05:13.560 --> 05:14.840
then what about Zheng Shiyuan?

05:15.680 --> 05:16.960
He's not just fencing stolen goods.

05:19.000 --> 05:22.000
To Prince Ying,
Zheng Shiyuan isn't essential.

05:22.520 --> 05:25.680
That old fox is so cunning,
so he must have a backup plan.

05:27.880 --> 05:28.880
If we let him go,

05:28.960 --> 05:32.280
Prince Ying, after these two lessons,
probably won't harm Zheng Shiyuan.

05:32.800 --> 05:35.200
But Zheng Shiyuan
won't want to be our bait either.

05:35.720 --> 05:37.320
So, he might

05:37.840 --> 05:42.000
take the hidden evidence and flee
or perhaps try to blackmail someone.

05:45.680 --> 05:48.760
But this ledger
only records that Jubao House

05:49.280 --> 05:51.840
buys colored gems
from Langhuan Dockyard each year.

05:51.920 --> 05:54.360
Yet Jubao House has never sold them,

05:54.440 --> 05:55.960
not even treasures
from the Western Regions.

05:56.040 --> 05:58.480
Just like with the Red Leaf Crown
back then,

05:58.560 --> 06:00.000
they couldn't come up with enough ruby.

06:00.080 --> 06:03.280
But Du Ming found a box
marked with Langhuan Dockyard's seal,

06:04.120 --> 06:05.840
which matches this ledger perfectly.

06:06.680 --> 06:09.440
If Yuchi Wuyi,
seemingly the Master of Langhuan Dockyard,

06:09.520 --> 06:11.680
is actually Li Kui and raids convoys,

06:12.720 --> 06:14.800
and Zheng Shiyuan fences
the stolen goods for him,

06:15.440 --> 06:17.200
while Prince Ying is the mastermind,

06:17.280 --> 06:19.160
then the flow of money doesn't add up.

06:19.800 --> 06:23.240
I think this money should go directly
to Chang'an into Prince Ying's hands.

06:23.320 --> 06:25.360
So, why did it go to Langhuan Dockyard?

06:26.600 --> 06:27.800
I feel

06:28.680 --> 06:30.600
it's not just about clearing
Prince Ying's name.

06:33.360 --> 06:37.280
What if Li Kui,
after taking the stolen money,

06:38.720 --> 06:41.120
transferred it directly
to Prince Ying's needs?

06:43.280 --> 06:44.640
Are you suggesting

06:47.000 --> 06:49.800
Prince Ying's raising bandits
to gain power, wealth, and troops?

06:50.640 --> 06:51.880
It's very likely.

06:51.960 --> 06:54.640
Perhaps with this ledger,
we can catch someone else.

06:54.720 --> 06:57.240
-That's right. I'll head there right away.
-How is it going?

06:57.320 --> 07:00.360
There's no time to lose.
I'm heading out now to capture Yuchi Wuyi.

07:01.040 --> 07:03.720
He's the key figure.
He must not be harmed.

07:03.800 --> 07:05.840
-Kang Ju, what are you doing?
-Don't worry about it!

07:11.440 --> 07:12.280
Duanwu,

07:14.280 --> 07:16.160
how are Cui Shijiu and Lady Yu?

07:17.320 --> 07:20.840
They're safe.
I've sent them back to Zhenlang Pavilion.

07:26.400 --> 07:27.360
Thank you for your efforts.

07:32.480 --> 07:35.280
Freshly baked rice cakes!

07:35.360 --> 07:37.240
Fragrant and sweet!

07:37.320 --> 07:38.160
GRAIN

07:38.240 --> 07:40.840
Freshly baked rice cakes!

07:40.920 --> 07:43.120
Fragrant and sweet!

07:43.200 --> 07:45.360
Freshly baked rice cakes!

07:45.440 --> 07:47.320
-Wait for me.
-Fragrant and sweet!

07:47.400 --> 07:49.320
-Two pieces, please.
-Coming right up!

07:52.240 --> 07:53.600
-Here, sir.
-Here.

07:53.680 --> 07:54.720
Thank you!

07:56.400 --> 07:58.400
Here. Try some.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.960
-Are you hungry?
-A little.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.280
Is it good?

08:10.840 --> 08:12.760
-Not bad.
-By the way,

08:14.600 --> 08:16.520
Supervisor Kang seems a bit off.

08:17.040 --> 08:19.040
Is there something
about Yuchi that I don’t know?

08:20.920 --> 08:23.920
Kang Ju has always been quirky,
you know that.

08:25.880 --> 08:26.760
Let's go.

08:49.520 --> 08:50.680
Are you not feeling well?

08:51.960 --> 08:53.880
I'm fine. I've got sand in my eye.

08:54.760 --> 08:55.880
Let me take a look.

09:05.680 --> 09:06.720
Feeling better now?

09:08.840 --> 09:11.960
Much better. It's fine now. Let's go back.

09:12.880 --> 09:13.760
Let's go.

09:31.520 --> 09:32.640
Inspector Zhang,

09:32.720 --> 09:35.240
His Highness isn't feeling well
and won't receive guests.

09:35.320 --> 09:36.160
Please return.

09:36.240 --> 09:39.600
Prince Ying is unwell,
so I wouldn't disturb him otherwise.

09:40.160 --> 09:42.080
But last night,
Zheng Shiyuan was attacked,

09:42.160 --> 09:43.040
and there's a key figure

09:43.120 --> 09:45.120
I must take back to the Grand Governor's
Office for questioning.

09:45.760 --> 09:46.720
Inspector Zhang!

09:48.040 --> 09:50.000
His Highness is a royal prince.

09:50.520 --> 09:53.320
Inspector Zhang,
you're overstepping your bounds.

10:20.680 --> 10:22.640
These past days,
you rarely leave this residence

10:22.720 --> 10:24.280
or see the light of day.

10:27.280 --> 10:28.960
Are you unwell?

10:32.840 --> 10:33.880
What did you do to me?

10:39.400 --> 10:40.640
You poisoned me?

10:40.720 --> 10:42.520
You're always so cautious,

10:43.040 --> 10:45.280
eating only dry rations for every meal

10:45.360 --> 10:48.640
and drinking only spring water
you fetch yourself.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.400
How could I possibly poison you?

11:01.800 --> 11:03.840
You poisoned me with intoxicating incense.

11:05.080 --> 11:07.720
You masked the scent with fruit fragrance.

11:09.520 --> 11:11.120
Since your failed rescue of Xu Nanying,

11:11.200 --> 11:14.520
returning injured and losing troops,

11:14.600 --> 11:17.280
it seems you're not as sharp as before.

11:22.840 --> 11:24.800
I finally fell for your trap.

11:34.920 --> 11:37.400
I dare not offend Prince Ying,

11:37.480 --> 11:41.760
but as for Yuchi Wuyi,
I must take him back.

11:41.840 --> 11:45.040
There's no such person
as Yuchi Wuyi in this villa.

11:49.000 --> 11:50.320
Well, that's troubling.

11:52.040 --> 11:54.960
Yuchi Wuyi must have infiltrated
the villa,

11:55.040 --> 11:56.600
and he's certainly
a threat to Prince Ying.

11:57.120 --> 11:58.760
-Guards!
-Here!

11:59.400 --> 12:02.000
Anyone who obstructs my mission
to protect Prince Ying…

12:07.040 --> 12:09.360
-kill without mercy!
-Yes, sir!

12:09.440 --> 12:12.640
Zheng Shiyuan is already dead.
Zhang Jinran is relentless.

12:14.440 --> 12:16.040
Hand over the pearl

12:16.120 --> 12:17.720
and we can still work together.

12:24.640 --> 12:27.320
Yuchi Wuyi,
you dared to assassinate Prince Ying!

12:30.400 --> 12:32.200
Isn't it obvious?

12:33.440 --> 12:34.800
We were just playing around.

12:36.520 --> 12:38.160
Why make such a big scene?

12:38.240 --> 12:40.560
I don't care if you two are joking around.

12:41.520 --> 12:43.800
Today, I have a case
involving the Black Dragon Bandits,

12:44.320 --> 12:45.480
and it's tied to him.

12:46.000 --> 12:47.680
I must take this man back.

12:47.760 --> 12:49.600
-Guards!
-Stop!

12:51.600 --> 12:53.560
Zhang Jinran, how dare you!

12:53.640 --> 12:55.400
I don't care about your big case.

12:56.320 --> 12:59.200
I guarantee he is not Li Kui.

13:02.440 --> 13:04.320
So, Prince Ying,
you know who Li Kui really is?

13:06.800 --> 13:08.680
What if I do?

13:09.200 --> 13:10.480
I assure he is not Li Kui.

13:11.080 --> 13:13.320
The one I'm arresting today isn't Li Kui

13:13.400 --> 13:14.760
but Yuchi Wuyi,
the Master of Langhuan Dockyard,

13:14.840 --> 13:17.200
who colluded with the Zheng family
to fence goods

13:17.280 --> 13:18.600
for the Black Dragon Bandits.

13:19.840 --> 13:21.240
-Take him away!
-Yes, sir!

13:21.760 --> 13:22.600
Get up!

13:22.680 --> 13:23.760
Move!

13:24.960 --> 13:25.840
Go!

13:39.520 --> 13:40.400
Hand over the item.

13:43.280 --> 13:44.800
-Give me the antidote!
-Kang Ju!

13:44.880 --> 13:47.720
-Are you even human?
-Kang Ju, calm down!

13:47.800 --> 13:49.480
Hand it over!

13:49.560 --> 13:51.720
Is it worth sacrificing yourself
for someone like him?

13:54.600 --> 13:56.480
-Give me the antidote!
-Quickly, take him away!

13:56.560 --> 13:57.600
Move!

13:57.680 --> 13:59.360
-Hand over the antidote!
-Hurry up!

13:59.440 --> 14:00.720
-Kang Ju!
-Kang Ju!

14:03.600 --> 14:06.640
Kang Ju, what antidote?

14:10.560 --> 14:12.200
Yan Zijing was poisoned.

14:12.960 --> 14:14.680
He's the only one with the antidote.

14:19.680 --> 14:21.160
-Mr. Zhang.
-What are you doing?

14:21.240 --> 14:23.680
Mr. Zhang, I'm begging you.

14:25.000 --> 14:26.480
Help me get the antidote.

14:31.360 --> 14:33.160
I'll make sure to get it for you.

14:37.600 --> 14:38.600
Thank you.

14:50.360 --> 14:51.680
Not feeling well again?

14:52.200 --> 14:53.120
It's fine.

14:53.880 --> 14:54.920
Take a rest.

14:56.840 --> 14:57.880
Take a rest.

15:01.760 --> 15:03.000
How's it going?

15:10.960 --> 15:12.040
How is it?

15:14.360 --> 15:16.040
They've captured Yuchi Wuyi.

15:16.120 --> 15:18.280
As long as he confesses,
Prince Ying will have no escape.

15:18.360 --> 15:21.040
And Zhang Jinran promised me.

15:23.880 --> 15:26.640
-He'll get you the antidote.
-Who allowed you to tell him this?

15:30.480 --> 15:31.600
If I didn't,

15:33.800 --> 15:35.240
what would you do?

15:36.520 --> 15:40.400
If Zhang Jinran gets played by Yuchi Wuyi
in his attempt to save me,

15:40.920 --> 15:42.680
won't all our efforts be wasted?

15:44.240 --> 15:45.400
Then, what about you?

15:56.160 --> 15:57.480
You can't go.

16:01.640 --> 16:02.640
Kang Ju,

16:02.720 --> 16:04.360
after all these years,

16:06.960 --> 16:08.280
you should know,

16:09.880 --> 16:11.560
all I want is for him to die.

16:36.720 --> 16:37.880
Yuchi Wuyi,

16:39.600 --> 16:41.280
even now, you won't speak?

16:46.800 --> 16:48.000
Then, let me tell you this:

16:49.720 --> 16:53.800
The Langhuan Dockyard you built
will be utterly destroyed.

16:54.520 --> 16:56.720
Even the Black Dragon Bandits
will be wiped out.

16:56.800 --> 16:58.600
And at this very moment,

16:59.240 --> 17:01.120
even Prince Ying
would rather see you dead,

17:01.800 --> 17:03.720
so he can pin all the blame on you.

17:08.200 --> 17:10.960
I'm the only one
who can save your life now.

17:13.200 --> 17:14.520
And today, I happen to be in the mood

17:15.839 --> 17:17.880
to give you a way out.

17:26.800 --> 17:28.079
What do you want?

17:28.160 --> 17:32.320
Prove that the Yan family was framed
in the Kang State tribute case

17:32.400 --> 17:35.040
and that the real mastermind behind
the Black Dragon Bandits is Prince Ying.

17:35.560 --> 17:37.560
Confess to everything truthfully,

17:38.880 --> 17:40.720
and I'll make sure you escape
the death penalty.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.840
You don't have time to think about it.

17:49.840 --> 17:50.760
Fine.

17:57.280 --> 17:59.120
I can testify against Prince Ying,

18:01.040 --> 18:02.800
but you must let me go.

18:04.080 --> 18:05.680
You want me to let you go?

18:06.920 --> 18:08.080
That's impossible.

18:09.360 --> 18:11.120
I can give you the antidote.

18:21.040 --> 18:22.040
I know

18:23.000 --> 18:24.800
you all want to save Yan Zijing.

18:26.880 --> 18:28.040
He can't hold out any longer.

18:28.840 --> 18:30.040
And you're running out of time too.

18:30.120 --> 18:32.360
Give me the antidote,
then we can talk about conditions!

18:38.160 --> 18:40.480
The water of Black Dragon Pool
is the deadliest poison,

18:40.560 --> 18:42.520
and I'm the only one who can cure it.

18:43.160 --> 18:45.040
If I give you the antidote now,

18:45.600 --> 18:47.200
will I still have a way out?

18:49.840 --> 18:51.000
Let me go,

18:51.880 --> 18:53.760
and I'll agree to all your terms.

18:56.320 --> 18:58.280
-Let me go.
-I don't care about your antidote!

19:05.800 --> 19:07.200
You promised me

19:08.480 --> 19:10.400
to clear the Yan family's name.

19:11.240 --> 19:13.200
If you're letting him go to save me,

19:15.720 --> 19:17.280
I'd rather kill him now,

19:17.840 --> 19:19.320
and that'll count
as bringing him to justice.

19:19.400 --> 19:20.360
Yan Zijing!

19:24.040 --> 19:25.080
Zhang Jinran,

19:27.520 --> 19:31.000
the Black Dragon Bandits
have been rampaging for years.

19:32.720 --> 19:34.120
If you let him go,

19:34.640 --> 19:38.800
how many more people will have to endure
what I've suffered?

19:39.400 --> 19:41.360
Just give me a little more time.
I'll get him to talk.

19:41.440 --> 19:43.000
-Then you can do what you want…
-I just want him dead!

19:47.560 --> 19:49.040
There's no need to waste time.

19:49.760 --> 19:51.880
He won't talk, and I don't need it anyway.

19:55.120 --> 19:57.040
How impressive!

19:57.760 --> 19:59.720
Don't listen to him. He's lying to you.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.640
No one can withstand a poison this deadly.

20:02.400 --> 20:05.560
First, he'll lose his sight,
and then he'll slowly die in torment.

20:05.640 --> 20:06.680
Shut up!

20:07.360 --> 20:08.560
Let me go!

20:08.640 --> 20:09.800
Let me go!

20:09.880 --> 20:11.560
I'll give you exactly
what you need right now.

20:11.640 --> 20:12.960
Yuchi Wuyi,

20:15.280 --> 20:17.080
you're about to die,
and you still don't see it.

20:17.920 --> 20:18.960
Let me tell you,

20:19.480 --> 20:21.760
your final fate
is to become a pile of bones,

20:21.840 --> 20:23.080
with no one to claim your remains.

20:23.760 --> 20:27.040
And the Prince Ying you're protecting
will trample over your corpse

20:27.120 --> 20:29.000
to maintain his wealth and glory.

20:33.080 --> 20:36.560
Back in Black Dragon Cave,
you should've killed me.

20:37.680 --> 20:38.880
Otherwise,

20:40.160 --> 20:42.400
you wouldn't be in this situation.

20:42.480 --> 20:44.560
I'll kill you right now!

20:45.880 --> 20:48.680
You can die with me!

20:59.240 --> 21:00.240
Yan Zijing!

21:01.240 --> 21:02.160
Yan Zijing!

21:04.160 --> 21:05.880
What poison did you take?
I'll find the imperial doctor.

21:10.760 --> 21:11.840
It's too late.

21:17.080 --> 21:18.080
My body

21:19.200 --> 21:20.200
is beyond saving.

21:25.600 --> 21:26.880
But promise me.

21:27.760 --> 21:29.000
Don't let Duanwu know

21:30.160 --> 21:31.480
about my condition.

21:33.520 --> 21:34.680
She'll find out eventually.

21:34.760 --> 21:36.320
Then let her find out when the time comes.

21:39.440 --> 21:41.320
All I want
with the little time I have left

21:42.880 --> 21:46.040
is to be with her more
and look at her a bit longer.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.240
That's enough for me.

21:51.760 --> 21:53.000
Promise me.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.720
Thank you.

22:57.000 --> 22:59.600
Yingtao, you're making a mess everywhere.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.920
I'm practicing my Iron Palm technique!

23:03.880 --> 23:05.880
You're like a child.

23:06.600 --> 23:07.480
I'm so tired.

23:10.000 --> 23:12.280
Supervisor Kang, stop zoning out.

23:12.360 --> 23:14.440
Have a longan. It's very sweet.

23:18.120 --> 23:18.960
Here.

23:21.200 --> 23:23.360
Why are we preparing so many beans?

23:24.680 --> 23:26.440
The Laba Festival is around the corner.

23:26.520 --> 23:28.720
We're making steaming hot Laba Porridge

23:28.800 --> 23:31.240
for every guest who comes in

23:31.320 --> 23:33.160
to show Clear Mind's hospitality.

23:33.240 --> 23:34.640
-That's wonderful.
-Indeed.

23:34.720 --> 23:37.120
Why don't you show me some kindness too?

23:38.520 --> 23:39.760
My mistake, Yingtao.

23:39.840 --> 23:42.120
You've worked so hard.
Here, let me massage your shoulders.

23:44.080 --> 23:46.280
You're doing this on purpose,
aren't you? I'll hit you!

23:46.360 --> 23:47.880
-I didn't mean it!
-Sit down.

23:47.960 --> 23:48.960
Alright then.

23:50.360 --> 23:52.680
Have some longan. You've worked hard too.

23:53.880 --> 23:56.200
Duanwu, look at the two of them.

23:56.280 --> 23:58.520
They're not working properly,
just flirting around.

23:58.600 --> 23:59.960
Get back to work.

24:05.880 --> 24:08.640
Duanwu, what are your plans
with Master Yan?

24:13.080 --> 24:14.440
She's too shy to say.

24:14.960 --> 24:16.160
She feels embarrassed.

24:16.680 --> 24:17.840
It's obvious.

24:21.280 --> 24:22.200
Where did Master Yan go?

24:23.000 --> 24:23.920
Yeah, where?

24:29.080 --> 24:32.280
He was worried
that Yuchi Wuyi wouldn't confess,

24:32.360 --> 24:33.680
so he went to the Grand Governor's Office.

24:33.760 --> 24:36.240
Yuchi Wuyi won't accept his fate quietly.

24:36.320 --> 24:37.880
He's bound to give up Prince Ying.

24:37.960 --> 24:39.640
-Rest assured.
-Exactly.

24:40.320 --> 24:41.680
Let's hope so.

24:42.760 --> 24:44.360
Don't worry, Supervisor Kang.

24:56.320 --> 25:00.400
Supervisor Kang, since Laba Porridge
uses the same ingredients,

25:00.480 --> 25:01.800
why make Longevity Porridge instead?

25:05.200 --> 25:06.720
Every household makes Laba Porridge.

25:07.560 --> 25:12.040
We're offering Longevity Porridge
for good blessings.

25:13.040 --> 25:13.880
Great idea.

25:13.960 --> 25:15.680
Supervisor Kang,
your suggestion is brilliant.

25:15.760 --> 25:16.800
It's meaningful.

25:16.880 --> 25:19.160
-Longevity and good health.
-Peace and prosperity!

25:19.240 --> 25:21.440
Exactly! Supervisor Kang
always thinks of everything.

25:31.080 --> 25:32.160
Duanwu.

25:34.800 --> 25:35.880
Master Yan.

25:40.240 --> 25:41.320
What's all this?

25:43.640 --> 25:46.440
It's Supervisor Kang's idea.
This year, we're making Longevity Porridge

25:46.960 --> 25:48.240
instead of Laba Porridge

25:48.840 --> 25:50.240
for good luck.

25:54.760 --> 25:55.840
Make plenty.

26:00.760 --> 26:01.920
Sure.

26:02.680 --> 26:04.800
What about Yuchi Wuyi?

26:04.880 --> 26:07.520
Zhang Jinran already took Yuchi Wuyi
to capture Prince Ying.

26:07.600 --> 26:08.440
Don't worry.

26:09.440 --> 26:10.280
Then…

26:12.640 --> 26:13.880
we'll soon get
what we've been working for.

26:16.040 --> 26:19.000
Let's hope we get what we want soon.

26:25.280 --> 26:26.480
We will.

26:31.760 --> 26:34.120
Need help with anything? What can I do?

26:34.200 --> 26:35.200
Sure.

26:36.680 --> 26:38.000
Help me pick the beans.

26:38.520 --> 26:39.400
Sure.

26:41.360 --> 26:42.240
Here.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.960
-Gaoshou, make her stop.
-I can't stop her.

26:45.040 --> 26:46.160
Let's pick the beans from this.

26:48.160 --> 26:49.440
Look…

26:54.640 --> 26:57.000
Stop eating. Those are for the guests!

26:59.160 --> 27:00.800
Supervisor Kang,
why don't you have some too?

27:01.840 --> 27:02.760
Just have some.

27:02.840 --> 27:04.880
-Let's all get some good luck.
-Here, Supervisor Kang.

27:04.960 --> 27:06.480
Your Highness, everything is packed,

27:06.560 --> 27:08.280
and the contacts
along the way are arranged.

27:08.360 --> 27:09.480
We can leave Yangzhou at any time.

27:11.520 --> 27:14.040
Your Highness,
if we don't leave now, it'll be too late.

27:14.560 --> 27:15.520
What about Yuchi Wuyi?

27:15.600 --> 27:17.920
Zhang Jinran hasn't left
the Grand Governor's Office.

27:18.560 --> 27:20.600
If we leave now,
we can still make it to the northwest.

27:20.680 --> 27:23.600
But if Yuchi Wuyi confesses,
it'll be too late by then.

27:23.680 --> 27:24.880
Your Highness.

27:26.680 --> 27:27.520
Your Highness…

27:28.960 --> 27:30.480
Even if I leave,

27:31.760 --> 27:33.840
I must take
the blood-stained pearl with me.

27:33.920 --> 27:34.800
Your Highness,

27:34.880 --> 27:37.560
Zhang Jinran must be working
on forcing Yuchi Wuyi to talk.

27:38.200 --> 27:40.280
Staying in Yangzhou is too dangerous,
Your Highness!

27:49.880 --> 27:51.840
Prince Ying, Yuchi Wuyi confessed

27:51.920 --> 27:53.800
you're the mastermind
behind the Black Dragon Bandits.

28:06.280 --> 28:07.840
I'm the mastermind?

28:14.360 --> 28:15.800
That's just a bandit's word.

28:17.280 --> 28:18.440
How is that trustworthy?

28:19.160 --> 28:21.800
Yuchi Wuyi did so much for you
behind the scenes

28:23.440 --> 28:24.920
and yet you wanted to steal his pearl.

28:25.920 --> 28:28.080
He won't just testify against you.

28:28.160 --> 28:31.040
He also told me there's more
correspondence proving your involvement

28:32.040 --> 28:33.880
hidden in Langhuan Dockyard.

28:35.560 --> 28:39.480
Guards, throw them out…

28:39.560 --> 28:40.680
Prince Ying,

28:40.760 --> 28:43.480
for years, you've enjoyed the riches
and privileges of your royal title,

28:43.560 --> 28:45.000
yet you've been amassing wealth
and raising troops,

28:45.080 --> 28:48.000
colluding with bandits
and oppressing the people.

28:49.000 --> 28:50.320
How can you face the Emperor?

28:51.160 --> 28:53.880
How can you face the taxpayers
who sustain you?

28:54.400 --> 28:57.840
Zhang Jinran,
it's not your place to scold me!

28:57.920 --> 28:59.320
I am a royal prince,

29:00.640 --> 29:03.520
trusted by the Emperor
and supported by the people.

29:03.600 --> 29:05.000
That is how it should be!

29:08.080 --> 29:10.000
How could you be so absurd now?

29:11.320 --> 29:12.440
Those who harm the people must die.

29:12.520 --> 29:14.080
Those who oppress the people
face punishment.

29:14.160 --> 29:16.480
The law is absolute,
even kings are not exempt.

29:17.960 --> 29:19.320
Don't you understand that?

29:23.560 --> 29:25.200
Search all documents and belongings!

29:26.440 --> 29:27.400
Yes, sir!

29:28.080 --> 29:30.200
-Take Prince Ying into custody.
-Yes, sir!

29:31.400 --> 29:32.480
-Don't move!
-Don't move!

29:34.120 --> 29:35.560
Dear guests,

29:35.640 --> 29:37.840
Clear Mind is offering
Longevity Porridge today!

29:37.920 --> 29:39.440
-Come, have a bowl!
-Peace and joy to you.

29:39.520 --> 29:40.680
-Thank you!
-Warming hearts and stomachs,

29:40.760 --> 29:41.680
peace and health!

29:41.760 --> 29:42.600
Come take a look!

29:42.680 --> 29:44.000
Everyone,
join us to share the good fortune!

29:45.560 --> 29:47.960
-Blessings and prosperity!
-Thank you, Ms. Su!

29:48.040 --> 29:50.560
Come on! Come have some porridge!

29:51.080 --> 29:52.520
Come share the good fortune!

29:53.040 --> 29:54.040
Come on!

29:54.120 --> 29:56.040
-Blessings and prosperity!
-Thank you, Ms. Su!

29:56.120 --> 29:59.200
Have a bowl of Longevity Porridge,
wishing you peace and health every year!

29:59.280 --> 30:00.280
Careful, it's hot!

30:01.200 --> 30:02.840
-Here you go. Be careful.
-Thank you!

30:04.000 --> 30:05.200
Blessings and prosperity!

30:05.280 --> 30:06.520
-Thank you, Ms. Su.
-Duanwu!

30:07.040 --> 30:09.200
-Duanwu…
-Come, have some porridge!

30:09.280 --> 30:10.320
Master Yan.

30:10.400 --> 30:11.320
Yingtao.

30:11.400 --> 30:12.600
Mr. Zhang, please.

30:13.960 --> 30:16.120
-This way.
-Put it down right here.

30:16.920 --> 30:18.080
How did it go?

30:19.800 --> 30:20.880
Last night…

30:20.960 --> 30:21.920
Thank you.

30:22.000 --> 30:23.640
I arrested Prince Ying.

30:23.720 --> 30:25.520
Blessings and prosperity!

30:25.600 --> 30:27.920
Clear Mind is serving porridge!
Longevity Porridge!

30:28.000 --> 30:29.880
-Wishing you peace and health every year!
-Here's yours.

30:31.960 --> 30:33.120
Share the good fortune!

30:33.720 --> 30:34.560
So…

30:36.920 --> 30:40.840
regarding the Yan family's wrongful case,
is it about to be cleared?

30:40.920 --> 30:42.080
Yes.

30:43.080 --> 30:44.600
That's why I'm here to bid farewell.

30:45.240 --> 30:47.880
I plan to personally escort
Prince Ying and Yuchi Wuyi

30:47.960 --> 30:49.360
to Chang'an for trial

30:50.240 --> 30:53.080
and clear the Yan family's name.

30:54.720 --> 30:55.600
Master Yan,

30:57.040 --> 30:57.960
wait for me to return.

31:01.200 --> 31:02.600
Thank you.

31:02.680 --> 31:05.760
-Peace and health, Longevity Porridge!
-Peace and health every year!

31:05.840 --> 31:06.960
By the way…

31:07.040 --> 31:09.480
Miss, your porridge is ready.

31:09.560 --> 31:11.360
Though the blood-stained pearl
is shattered,

31:11.440 --> 31:14.080
-Sir, here's yours.
-the map on it has been drawn.

31:14.600 --> 31:15.840
Duanwu and I believe

31:16.560 --> 31:18.080
this doesn't belong to us.

31:18.600 --> 31:21.320
So, please, present it to His Majesty.

31:22.320 --> 31:23.920
Blessings and prosperity!

31:24.000 --> 31:24.840
Don't worry.

31:24.920 --> 31:26.120
Here's yours.

31:27.400 --> 31:28.560
I'll take my leave now.

31:29.400 --> 31:30.240
Mr. Zhang…

31:30.320 --> 31:31.600
May everyone enjoy
peace and health every year.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.600
Gaoshou. Serve the Longevity Porridge.

31:34.360 --> 31:35.320
Thank you.

31:36.560 --> 31:37.400
-Here, Mr. Zhang.
-Come.

31:37.480 --> 31:38.440
-Have this Longevity Porridge.
-Yours.

31:38.520 --> 31:39.880
-Careful, it's hot.
-Thank you.

31:39.960 --> 31:40.920
-Thank you so much!
-Peace and health every year!

31:41.000 --> 31:43.560
-Try it.
-Everyone, line up and get yours!

31:44.120 --> 31:45.120
Here, miss,

31:45.840 --> 31:47.560
-hold it steady.
-It's so sweet.

31:48.080 --> 31:49.200
After drinking this bowl
of Longevity Porridge,

31:49.280 --> 31:51.080
you're sure to have a safe journey.

31:51.160 --> 31:54.000
But isn't today Laba Festival?
Why are we drinking Longevity Porridge?

31:54.080 --> 31:57.240
Supervisor Kang decided
that this year's Laba Festival

31:58.040 --> 31:59.280
should be different from usual.

32:00.480 --> 32:01.480
Hold it steady.

32:01.560 --> 32:03.000
Longevity Porridge!

32:03.080 --> 32:04.920
-Longevity Porridge!
-Here, miss.

32:05.000 --> 32:08.480
With Laba Festival
and this added celebration, why not…

32:08.560 --> 32:09.600
Don't spill it.

32:09.680 --> 32:11.800
-…light the firecrackers?
-Sir, here's yours.

32:11.880 --> 32:13.000
Gaoshou.

32:13.080 --> 32:14.360
-Grab the firecrackers.
-Hold it steady.

32:14.440 --> 32:15.520
Alright!

32:17.960 --> 32:19.520
Longevity Porridge for blessings

32:20.640 --> 32:21.560
and firecrackers to ward off evil.

32:21.640 --> 32:28.240
May everyone be as happy and healthy
as we are today.

32:28.320 --> 32:29.280
CLEAR MIND

32:29.360 --> 32:31.840
-Wonderful!
-Happy and healthy!

32:31.920 --> 32:35.160
-Great! Health and peace!
-Master Yan, peace and health every year.

32:36.960 --> 32:38.000
Thank you.

32:38.080 --> 32:38.960
Safe travels.

32:40.040 --> 32:41.040
Thank you…

33:15.760 --> 33:16.600
Good!

33:16.680 --> 33:19.200
-Bravo!
-Great!

33:19.280 --> 33:21.320
-Oh… I'll go check on the kitchen
-Bravo!

33:21.400 --> 33:23.040
-to see if there's anything I can do.
-Alright.

33:23.120 --> 33:24.240
Look after things here.

33:25.280 --> 33:27.120
Thank you…

33:30.200 --> 33:31.160
Thank you.

33:32.720 --> 33:33.800
Thank you…

33:33.880 --> 33:35.120
Thank you.

33:42.800 --> 33:44.800
-Share the good fortune!
-Come! Have some porridge!

33:44.880 --> 33:46.000
Thank you!

33:46.080 --> 33:48.200
-Peace and health every year!
-Health and happiness!

33:48.280 --> 33:49.560
-Thank you!
-Here's yours.

33:49.640 --> 33:52.320
I heard Clear Mind is serving
Longevity Porridge today.

33:52.400 --> 33:53.600
Can I get a bowl too?

33:53.680 --> 33:56.920
-Come. Everyone gets a bowl.
-There's none left. It's all gone!

34:12.600 --> 34:13.440
It tasted great.

34:15.040 --> 34:16.199
I'm glad you like it.

34:35.639 --> 34:41.080
Having brushed past death's door,
I've come to realize how precious life is.

34:44.199 --> 34:46.120
So, for today's Longevity Porridge,

34:46.199 --> 34:47.600
you're the one who deserves it most.

35:25.520 --> 35:29.520
At last, the era of the Cuis and Zhengs
has finally come to an end.

35:31.640 --> 35:33.760
The jewelry guild also deserves
a new beginning.

35:36.080 --> 35:39.800
Indeed, the guild needs a new head now.

35:45.800 --> 35:46.840
What do you think?

35:48.720 --> 35:51.920
-Are you planning to take on the role?
-Why not?

35:52.000 --> 35:53.800
I've long wanted to break
those outdated rules

35:53.880 --> 35:56.960
about passing the guild to men, not women.

35:57.960 --> 36:01.840
What I want is a thriving,

36:01.920 --> 36:04.040
vibrant new jewelry guild.

36:04.640 --> 36:05.880
What about you?

36:07.400 --> 36:09.280
All I want for the future guild

36:10.400 --> 36:12.120
is that for small merchants,

36:12.960 --> 36:15.760
they'll have time
not only to manage their little business,

36:16.320 --> 36:19.400
but also to craft better jewelry.

36:20.480 --> 36:23.800
For large merchants,
they can carry grand ambitions,

36:25.200 --> 36:26.480
heading beyond the borders,

36:28.000 --> 36:29.320
beyond Huainandao,

36:29.840 --> 36:32.640
to Chang'an and even further.

36:33.240 --> 36:34.240
Amazing.

36:36.160 --> 36:38.920
Your ambitions are so grand.

36:42.120 --> 36:42.960
Grand?

36:45.480 --> 36:48.520
Traveling far shows how small you are.

36:48.600 --> 36:50.000
The world is vast.

36:51.360 --> 36:53.520
From the pearl farm to now,

36:54.120 --> 36:55.960
traveling all the way from north to south,

36:56.920 --> 36:58.480
this is all I've come to know.

37:00.120 --> 37:03.800
Do you still wish to journey
thousands of miles with that person?

37:15.840 --> 37:16.880
I do.

38:01.280 --> 38:03.160
Master Yan hasn't returned yet?

38:03.240 --> 38:04.640
Not yet. I haven't seen him.

38:06.880 --> 38:08.760
Duanwu, come look at this.

38:10.040 --> 38:13.000
I feel like these designs aren't
good enough for the Jewel Exhibition.

38:14.480 --> 38:16.640
But I think each one looks beautiful.

38:17.160 --> 38:18.360
Ms. Su has high standards.

38:22.120 --> 38:26.120
What if we make these necklaces
into a complete set?

38:26.960 --> 38:27.920
How about that?

38:28.680 --> 38:30.200
Even then, it's just jewelry.

38:30.280 --> 38:31.960
The champion
of this Yangzhou Jewel Exhibition

38:32.040 --> 38:33.400
will have their work sent to the palace,

38:33.480 --> 38:35.720
personally selected by the Emperor
as the state gift of Tang.

38:35.800 --> 38:37.680
It can't be as simple as just jewelry.

38:38.760 --> 38:41.160
Then, how about this glass vase?

38:42.760 --> 38:45.480
Our vase-making techniques
are still underdeveloped.

38:45.560 --> 38:47.160
They can't compare to Persian glass.

38:47.840 --> 38:50.520
Yunxiu, I think you've already done
an excellent job.

38:50.600 --> 38:52.000
Exactly, Lady Shiqi.

38:52.080 --> 38:52.920
Even Mr. Qin said

38:53.000 --> 38:55.160
your control over the heat
surpasses his now.

38:55.840 --> 38:57.600
No rush. Take it slow.

39:39.080 --> 39:40.880
It's done!

39:41.400 --> 39:45.480
Ms. Su, the colorful glass is complete!

39:50.280 --> 39:51.160
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

39:52.400 --> 39:55.240
Mr. Qin, you actually made it!

39:56.240 --> 39:59.320
Then, we can use the colorful glass
to participate in the Jewel Exhibition!

40:01.240 --> 40:04.440
Duanwu, what should we make
with this colorful glass?

40:07.000 --> 40:08.680
We need to think carefully about that.

40:12.120 --> 40:13.040
Master Yan is here!

40:14.480 --> 40:15.520
You're all here.

40:23.240 --> 40:24.080
You've succeeded!

40:24.680 --> 40:25.760
Yunxiu, take this.

40:29.240 --> 40:30.960
How's the colorful glass?

40:31.640 --> 40:32.480
Nice.

40:32.560 --> 40:35.240
Does it look exactly like the one
my father made back then?

40:35.320 --> 40:38.840
Even better than the one from back then.
Congratulations.

40:39.800 --> 40:43.320
I didn't expect
Mr. Qin to achieve it so fast.

40:45.640 --> 40:47.520
Come over here.

40:48.840 --> 40:50.160
I just went out

40:50.760 --> 40:52.640
to buy you some supper.

40:53.160 --> 40:55.280
When I left,
I saw the lights were still on.

40:55.360 --> 40:56.720
I thought you must still be awake,

40:56.800 --> 41:00.120
so I got your favorite wontons
from the bridge stall.

41:00.200 --> 41:01.040
Come, have a taste.

41:04.760 --> 41:06.000
Thank you.

41:13.520 --> 41:16.360
So, have you decided
what to make with the colorful glass?

41:18.440 --> 41:19.680
Not yet.

41:21.280 --> 41:24.480
But I am thinking
of making you a new coat,

41:24.560 --> 41:25.800
something warmer.

41:27.800 --> 41:29.240
Why do you suddenly
want to make clothes for me?

41:36.480 --> 41:38.600
New Year calls for new things.

41:40.840 --> 41:42.320
It's a sign of good fortune.

41:43.960 --> 41:47.360
I'll make you something every year,
then you won't find it so curious.
